findings.body:
The `@require_role("admin")` guard is removed from `delete_user`. The `require_role` decorator (lines 8-15) aborts with 403 unless `ROLES.get(user) == "admin"`. After this change any caller can delete entries from `USERS`.

```suggestion
@app.route("/users/<user>", methods=["DELETE"])
@require_role("admin")
def delete_user(user):
```
